    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d553">

                <pb facs="0670" n="628" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg628"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 6, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 22d ultimo, asking to be allowed to postpone for a
                    short time responding to the <pb facs="0671" n="629" xml:id="pg629"/> invitation
                    extended to you in my note of the 21st of May, to designate some person to
                    confer with Acting Rear-Admiral Theodoras Bailey, in order to ascertain and
                    agree upon the damages to he paid in the case of the Mont Blanc, and to state,
                    in reply, that your request is cheerfully acceded to.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your very obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
